{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25409","headline":"忆金门旧游奉寄江西沈大夫 · 李德裕","name":"忆金门旧游奉寄江西沈大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东望沧溟路几重，无因白首更相逢。\n已悲泉下双琪树，又惜天边一卧龙。\n人事升沉才十载，宦游漂泊过千峰。\n思君远寄西山药，岁暮相期向赤松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25409.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25409","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}